Day 11 — Database, Outputs, Sidecars, Functions

Ansible — Install MariaDB

---
- name: Install and Start MariaDB
  hosts: all
  become: yes

  tasks:
   - name: Install MariaDB
     yum:
        name: pathnex-MariaDB
        state: present
    
   - name: Start maria DB in server
     server: 
        name: MariaDB
        state: started
        enabled: yes

